  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El PSPV-PSOE de la provincia de Castell&oacute; ha celebrado la tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles en Onda un acto, dentro dela campa&ntilde;a a las Elecciones Europeas, &quot;para reivindicar un programa de reindustrializaci&oacute;n, tras la nefasta gesti&oacute;n del Gobierno del Partido Popular en estos 18 a&ntilde;os al frente de la Generalitat Valenciana en cuando&nbsp; el impulso de pol&iacute;ticas industriales&rdquo;, seg&uacute;n indica una nota de su Gabinete de Comunicaci&oacute;n. </span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mittingpsoeeuropees14/cassolamitingpsoeeuropees210514.jpg\" alt=\"cassolamitingpsoeeuropees210514\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mittingpsoeeuropees14/img_1184.jpg\" alt=\"img_1184\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mittingpsoeeuropees14/img_1186.jpg\" alt=\"img_1186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mittingpsoeeuropees14/img_1187.jpg\" alt=\"img_1187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mittingpsoeeuropees14/img_1188.jpg\" alt=\"img_1188\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mittingpsoeeuropees14/img_1189.jpg\" alt=\"img_1189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mittingpsoeeuropees14/img_1190.jpg\" alt=\"img_1190\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mittingpsoeeuropees14/img_1191.jpg\" alt=\"img_1191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><